          "text": "Reference class and base rate: the immediate FRED/BEA DSPI reference class is the five latest same-variant monthly levels: 23395.9, 23382.4, 23510.4, 23486.9, and 23651.7. Month-to-month changes over that span were -13.5, +128.0, -23.5, and +164.8 billion, so a naive latest-level-plus-recent-average prior would be around 23715, but the May relief-payment composition argues for pulling that down."
