          "text": "The reference class is the four latest fetched monthly DSPI changes: -13.5, +128.0, -23.5, and +164.8 billion. Their mean is +63.95 billion, median is +57.25 billion, and sample standard deviation is 96.5 billion. This supplies the base rate, while the $23,651.7 billion May level supplies the persistence anchor."
