          "text": "The target is the Canada total for regular-benefit recipients, seasonally adjusted, both sexes and age 15 years and over, in Statistics Canada Table 14-10-0011-01. All anchors below use this same variant. The table reports persons, converted to thousands by multiplying by 0.001."
