          "text": "Framing and exact resolver: this forecast targets Census/HUD New Residential Construction first-print privately owned housing units started, United States total, seasonally adjusted annual rate, for June 2026. The target variant is Table 3a starts SAAR, not not-seasonally-adjusted starts, permits, completions, or later revised historical data."
