          "text": "Prior local Thesis run check: a prior public repository run for the same target used a 1.820 million point with a much tighter 1.810 to 1.830 million interval. I keep the point direction but widen the interval because the prompt requires sizing from realized dispersion of successive changes rather than a rounded hedged band."
