          "kind": "math",
          "text": "Point calculation: 1.814 latest + 0.004 momentum + 0.003 weak-hiring duration adjustment - 0.001 low-initial-claims inflow adjustment = 1.820 million. Interval calculation: sigma = 0.006 million; 1.28*sigma = 0.008 million; widened half-width = 0.010 million, so 1.820 - 0.010 = 1.810 and 1.820 + 0.010 = 1.830 million."
