          "text": "Framing and exact resolver: the target is the DOL ETA regular state programs seasonally adjusted insured unemployment series, also called continued claims, for the week ending June 27, 2026. The resolution is the advance first print in the weekly claims release, in millions of persons, ignoring later revisions."
