          "text": "Framing and exact resolver: this is BLS CPI-U all items, U.S. city average, seasonally adjusted month-over-month percent change for June 2026, first print. The series variant is headline CPI-U SA MoM; all CPI anchors below use the same BLS headline SA table, not NSA index levels or core CPI as the target."
