          "text": "The target is Table 1, \u201cDeficit/Surplus (-),\u201d for the July 2026 monthly flow, not fiscal-year-to-date receipts or outlays. Table 1 reports $ millions; I convert to billions and reverse its presentation convention so a deficit is positive. The resolver is the original first print only."
