          "text": "The target is the first-print July 2026 monthly Deficit/Surplus (-) in MTS Table 1, not the fiscal-year-to-date balance. Table 1 is denominated in $ millions; I divide by 1000 and reverse the table's sign convention so deficits are positive. Later revisions are excluded."
