          "text": "The resolver is BLS Real Earnings Table A-1: the seasonally adjusted over-the-month percent change in real average hourly earnings for all employees on private nonfarm payrolls. This is the all-employees, CPI-U-deflated variant, not the production-and-nonsupervisory CPI-W series; resolve only to the July first print, rounded to BLS's one decimal, with no later revision substitution."
