          "text": "Framing and exact resolver: this forecast is for BLS Real Earnings Table A-1, all employees on private nonfarm payrolls, seasonally adjusted, real average hourly earnings over-the-month percent change for July 2026. The target resolves to the one-decimal first print on the BLS official release page, with no later revision used."
